name: Hideout Furniture — Runtime Editor and Workbench
author: Hardcoon
version: 0.5.75
description: Shared IX-Ray editor, Hideout Furniture 2.3.2, Expansion 1.0.2, Even More Hideout Furniture Update 2, native QA doors and portable repair, upgrade and crafting workbench. 191 furniture items, three portable campfires with native lighting transitions, cooking and seven edible cooked meats, paired door placement actions, modes 1/2/3 with fixed preview, remembered Q display styles, R rotation axes and 15-metre placement, translucent previews, unlimited lights, NPC doors and 1.4-second Use pickup. Stock first wave adds 28 inventory items and 37 placement visuals using original game OGF/DDS references, grouped tools and five fence variants.
